            "derivation": "Order exponent groups 23,24,25,26,27. Within exponent 23 use 3.17<6.40, giving Mercury,Mars. Within 24 use 4.87<5.40<5.98, giving Venus,Pluto,Earth. Exponent 25 gives Uranus. Within 26 use 1.03<5.69, giving Neptune,Saturn. Exponent 27 gives Jupiter. Concatenating these exponent groups yields the stated complete global order.",
